  "purpose": "Track the bounded Termux upstream stack used by LuHm's S24 FE/Termux/proot lane without treating upstream repositories as LuHm source authority.",
  "sourceLaw": "Upstream Termux facts are provider evidence. GitHub is LuHm compatibility layer #2 and stores pins, manifests, audits and receipts.",
